# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: Apple-Media (Custom)
# Description: Apple Media services (Apple TV+, Apple News, Fitness+)
# Scope: Region-locked media endpoints requiring US/Media egress
# Note: tv.apple.com is covered by upstream AppleTV list;
#       Custom retains verified Apple News, Apple Fitness+ and auxiliary live streams.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Apple TV+ Live Streams ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tv.applemusic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,linear.tv.apple.com

# --- Apple News ---
# Target: Apple News app feed and media assets
# Evidence: iOS Apple News app network logs, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Geo-restricted service requiring US/UK exit; isolated from base Apple services
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-assets.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-client.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-edge.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.news

# --- Apple Fitness+ ---
# Target: Apple Fitness+ workout video API and streams
# Evidence: Apple Watch workout video session trace, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Geo-restricted service requiring US exit
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amp-api.fitness.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fitness.apple.com
